{"availability":"available","full":"ismayc/premier-league","name":"premier-league","description":"Unofficial Premier League fixture viewer — kickoff times in your timezone, where to watch, the live table with home/away splits, season stats with player leaderboards, team sheets & lineups, calendar export, and every final table since 1992-93. React + Vite.","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-20T18:40:11Z","updated":"2026-10-07T06:26:16Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ismayc.github.io/premier-league/","topics":["epl","fixtures","football","netlify","premier-league","react","schedule","soccer","vite"],"demo":"https://ismayc.github.io/premier-league/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:34.124Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:34.124Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:34.124Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T22:54:35.642Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:11:34.124Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A React + Vite web app showing all 380 matches of the Premier League season in your timezone, with where to watch, the live table, season statistics, team sheets, and every final table since the competition began in 1992-93.","ESPN's standings archive only reaches 2002-03. openfootball publishes match results back to 1992-93, so fetch-history.mjs parses those results and computes each table itself, applying the same ordering rules the live table uses — points, then goal difference, then goals scored. The Premier League has never used head-to-head to separate clubs for a placing.","That makes the tables verifiable rather than merely copied. Before writing, every season is checked against invariants that must hold for any correct parse: total appearances equal twice the match count, goal difference across the league sums to zero, and points equal three per decisive match plus two per draw. A season that fails is reported rather than silently written. Those same invariants run again in test/history-data.test.js over the committed data, so a bad refresh fails the build instead of shipping a wrong table."],"features":["Your timezone — kickoff times auto-convert to your detected timezone","(switchable to 15+), with the zone shown on each card and UK time alongside in the match detail, so the app can be checked against any published fixture list.","Five views — a chronological Fixtures list grouped by day, a","Monday–Sunday Week calendar, the live Table, season Stats, and History back to 1992-93.","Fixture cards — each match shows kickoff time and zone (or a Final / Live"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ismayc/premier-league/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5296dbbbaa204a0b181286d927ea40cebbf7d7666d3c2085352daae6509100db","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T22:54:35.753Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:34.213Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A React + Vite web app showing all 380 matches of the Premier League season in your timezone, with where to watch, the live table, season statistics, team sheets, and every final table since the competition began in 1992-93.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ismayc/premier-league/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"5296dbbbaa204a0b181286d927ea40cebbf7d7666d3c2085352daae6509100db","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ismayc/premier-league/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:34.214Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T06:26:16Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ismayc/premier-league/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:34.215Z","hash":"5296dbbbaa204a0b181286d927ea40cebbf7d7666d3c2085352daae6509100db","originalBytes":14276,"storedBytes":14276,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["season","live","data","league","table","match","app","every","fixtures","clubs","fixture","list","any","club","espn","rather","